1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:20,039
Here's a token of my friendship.

2
00:00:20,039 --> 00:00:23,960
They said I had this when I came here.

3
00:00:23,960 --> 00:00:27,560
I don't really remember.

4
00:00:27,560 --> 00:00:29,400
That's important to you, isn't it?

5
00:00:29,399 --> 00:00:32,320
You can give me something else.

6
00:00:32,320 --> 00:00:33,600
No.

7
00:00:33,600 --> 00:00:35,159
You can have it, Hugo.

8
00:00:35,159 --> 00:00:38,920
You're giving me your most treasured possession.

9
00:00:38,920 --> 00:00:39,920
Thank you.

10
00:00:39,920 --> 00:00:42,640
I'll take good care of it.

11
00:00:42,640 --> 00:00:44,640
We'll always be friends, Mano.
